WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.874 --> 00:00:03.791
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Vienna, tell us about your plan.

2
00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:07.287
Why are you going to walk from Venice to China?

3
00:00:13.023 --> 00:00:15.391
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> It’s an amazing adventure!

4
00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:21.832
I’m going to do the same journey that the famous Venetian traveller Marco Polo did.

5
00:00:22.029 --> 00:00:23.918
It’s called the Silk Road.

6
00:00:24.129 --> 00:00:31.669
But you know, Marco Polo started it when he was only 17, and I’m starting it at 72!

7
00:00:31.937 --> 00:00:34.136
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> When are you going to leave home?

8
00:00:34.291 --> 00:00:37.490
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> I’m going to start the journey next week.

9
00:00:37.744 --> 00:00:44.749
First, I’m going to walk to Slovenia. Then from Slovenia to Croatia, and then Bulgaria.

10
00:00:44.932 --> 00:00:48.018
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How many countries are you going to go through?

11
00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:52.444
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> Thirteen – that’s not counting Italy and China.

12
00:00:52.514 --> 00:00:58.758
Some very exciting places, like Kazakhstan, Mongolia…

13
00:00:59.519 --> 00:01:01.760
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> And how long is it going to take?

14
00:01:01.802 --> 00:01:05.396
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> A long time. Probably three years.

15
00:01:05.396 --> 00:01:07.891
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Wow! Are you nervous?

16
00:01:07.962 --> 00:01:11.217
Do you think the journey is going to be dangerous?

17
00:01:11.513 --> 00:01:15.460
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> I’m a little nervous, but I’m ready for the challenge.

18
00:01:15.502 --> 00:01:21.323
And I have an app on my phone so that my doctor in Italy can check my health.

19
00:01:21.534 --> 00:01:24.240
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Are you going to take a lot of photos?

20
00:01:24.268 --> 00:01:25.720
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> Yes, I am.

21
00:01:25.861 --> 00:01:32.006
I also want to make videos of my journey, so I’m going to use a GoPro camera.

22
00:01:32.246 --> 00:01:36.122
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What’s going to be the most difficult thing about the journey?

23
00:01:36.446 --> 00:01:38.320
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> Probably the weather!

24
00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:41.675
It’s going to be very cold in Mongolia.

25
00:01:42.577 --> 00:01:44.338
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Where are you going to stay?

26
00:01:44.465 --> 00:01:47.510
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> I’m not going to stay in hotels.

27
00:01:47.608 --> 00:01:54.261
I want to stay with local people I meet along the way, so I can listen to their different stories.

28
00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:56.614
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Well, good luck Vienna –

29
00:01:56.741 --> 00:02:01.110
I’m going to follow your journey on social media to see how it’s going.

30
00:02:01.209 --> 00:02:02.858
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> Thank you very much.